OL,3,GNEWSA'Throwing #1.5bn out the window
OL,4,Anot sustainable', says Justice minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Executive needs to
OL,7,F"accept the reality" that there is no
OL,8,Fmore money on offer from the UK
OL,9,Fgovernment to help stabilise Northern
OL,10,FIreland's finances, Alliance Party
OL,11,Fleader Naomi Long has said.
OL,13,FLong, who is also justice minister, was
OL,14,Fspeaking ahead of an urgent executive
OL,15,Fmeeting on the negotiations.
OL,17,FNo budget has been agreed by the
OL,18,Fpower-sharing coalition six months into
OL,19,Fthe financial year, with Stormont
OL,20,Fparties pressing Westminster for more
OL,21,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
