OL,3,GNEWSA'Throwing #1.5bn out the window
OL,4,Anot sustainable', says Justice minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant last week instructed his
OL,8,Fofficials to consider "contingency
OL,9,Fplans" after a deadline passed for
OL,10,Fministers to consider a "final offer"
OL,11,Fof #1.5bn extra money.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
